{"The else if (filterConditions) and else branches in getBaseConditions are unreachable dead code. getAuthorizationConditions() always returns a Prisma.Sql object (never null or undefined), so authConditions is always truthy.": 0.6072685718536377, "The InsightsBookingServicePublicOptions type declares teamId as optional across all scopes, but the zod schema requires teamId for scope: 'team'. TypeScript won't catch missing teamId at compile time - the error only surfaces at runtime via zod validation, silently returning NOTHING_CONDITION. Should be refactored to a discriminated union to match the zod schema's intent.": 0.8025685548782349, "The entire 'Caching' describe block was removed from tests, but the caching logic (cachedAuthConditions, cachedFilterConditions) still exists in the implementation. This leaves the caching behavior untested - a second call could silently return stale or incorrect cached values without any test catching it.": 0.687519371509552}